  "body": "Sixteen narrated MLAI/Quesar films in 1080p at 30 fps: four editions for each 1, 2, 3 and 10 minute running time.\n\nQuesar architecture and studio editions use new Abbey browser Kokoro narration through the shared Web Audio processing graph, measured captions, and redesigned editorial scenes. MLAI editions preserve their complete original browser neural performances with restrained visual and audio mastering. The existing Kokoro model is used; this is not a newly trained proprietary voice model.\n\nEach master has an exact-duration/frame-count receipt, full FFmpeg decode, SHA256, and measured loudness/true peak. The provenance bundle contains captions, transcripts, timelines/edits and verification records. Source labels distinguish current implementation from illustrative workflows and roadmap.\n\nTechnical verification and sampled browser playback do not establish subjective listening or full-duration visual acceptance; those remain pending. The prior trailer-editions-2026-10-09 release is retained.\n"
